The '''Singing Crystal Mines''' is a mining corporation located in [[Snowhill]], in which mostly [[Pixies|pixies]], [[Chugawugs|chugawugs]], and [[Dwarves|dwarves]] work. It is one of the five [[Mines|mines]] in-game and one of the three to be found in an actual cave; the others being in [[Briarwood]] and in the [[Southern Wilds]] near the [[Lavender Coast Pass]] [[Warpstones|warpstone]]. It is full of different mining games of different materials, mostly copper ore and turquoise. Moreover, it's the largest mine in material.

Outside sits the welding anvil for [[Blacksmith]]'s making this possibly the best location work to work with in blacksmithing before the release of [[Sunstone Valley]].

